## Input

```css
.native {
  color: if(style(--status: complete): seagreen; else: gray);
  background: if(not (media(print)): white; else: black);
  border-color: if(style(--status: complete) and supports(display: grid): red; else: blue);
  outline-color: if(media(width > 1px) or style(--enabled: true): red; else: blue);
}
.after { display: block; }

